    "summary": "The measure of a stored area now reads a symbol scope by its entity's id and a file scope by the entities of its file, counts only entities of the scope's repository, and falls back to the whole-repository read when the narrow read finds none, so every result is the one the whole read gives. The index check made while a code or docs scope is resolved is unchanged and is, through measureRequestScope, the only whole-repository read left for such a scope. One follow-up from the gate's note on t1 is included: a direct measure of one source with a signal already aborted returns before its pool is loaded. Five falsifying mutations were each caught.",
